{
  "id": 462287080,
  "iid": 23827,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Profiles: Ignore directories with invalid characters",
  "description": "When determining folders for profiles, do a sanity check that the folder name would make a valid profile name before including it in the list, otherwise the user would be forced to modify the \"folder name\" to adhere to profile rules.  This is very undesired, for example, in the case of using a .git folder in Windows.\nSo if the folder name doesn't make a valid profile name, just skip considering it as a profile\n\nFixes #18736\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T16:05:43.748Z",
